 "groups": [
  {
   "shots": [
    "01",
    "02",
    "03",
    "04"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Hold a plastic bag over a fire, let go, and it flies! Congratulations, you've built a hot-air balloon!",
     "key": [
      "balloon"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "05"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "ben",
     "text": "Whoa!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "06",
    "07"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Hot air spreads out, so a box of it weighs less than a box of cold air.",
     "key": [
      "lighter"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "08",
    "09"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "But once it cools down, it sinks right back... and lands on Ben."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "10",
    "11"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "That bag lifts a cookie. But not Ben.",
     "key": [
      "cookie"
     ]
    },
    {
     "who": "ben",
     "text": "Come on!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "12",
    "12b"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "One cubic metre of hot air lifts about a sandwich. Ben needs six hundred of them.",
     "key": [
      "sandwich",
      "hundred"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "13"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "So you sew up a bag the size of a house.",
     "key": [
      "house"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "14"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "neighbour",
     "text": "Are those my bedsheets?"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "15",
    "16"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Blow cold air in with a fan to open it up,",
     "key": [
      "fan"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "17",
    "18"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "then fire the burner. The hot air stands it up!",
     "key": [
      "burner"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "19"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Ben climbs in with a sandwich,",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "20",
    "21"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "you untie the rope, and up, up, up he goes!",
     "key": [
      "up"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "22"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "The hotter the air inside, the harder it lifts.",
     "key": [
      "hotter"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "23",
    "24"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "ben",
     "text": "Lunch time!"
    },
    {
     "text": "So he turns the burner off.",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "25",
    "26"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "But the air inside cools down, and below sixty-seven degrees it can't hold him up,",
     "key": [
      "cools"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "27"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "so it sinks, right towards the neighbour.",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "28"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "ben",
     "text": "My sandwich!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "29"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Right on target.",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "30",
    "31"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Ben fires the burner, but the air takes a few seconds to heat up, so it keeps on sinking.",
     "key": [
      "seconds"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "32"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "neighbour",
     "text": "Hey! My roof!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "33",
    "34"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "And balloons don't come with a steering wheel, Ben.",
     "key": [
      "steering"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "35"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "But the wind blows different ways at different heights,",
     "key": [
      "heights"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "36"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "so you climb into the wind that goes your way.",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "37",
    "38"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Next stop: grandma's garden, round the corner.",
     "key": [
      "grandma's"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "39",
    "40"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "To come down, pull the vent. Hot air rushes out of the top,",
     "key": [
      "vent"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "41"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "and down, down, down you go.",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "42"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "ben",
     "text": "Too much! Too much!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "43",
    "44"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "The basket hits the lawn, and the wind drags it along,",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "45"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "until the whole thing flops over the washing line.",
     "key": []
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "46"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "text": "Congratulations, you've built a hot-air balloon!",
     "key": [
      "balloon"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "47"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "grandma",
     "text": "You could have taken the bus, dear."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shots": [
    "48"
   ],
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "ben",
     "text": "I know."
    }
   ]
  }
